Comment: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,接下來要做什麼呢?
Comment: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個嘛...
Comment: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我想去 Pasticceria Manicagni
Comment: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是可以啦
Comment: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這又讓我想起初春整個人貼在玻璃櫃前猶豫不決的場景
Comment: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為 每個都看起來很好吃嘛
Comment: 0,0:00:19.23,0:00:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不可能馬上就挑好啦
Comment: 0,0:00:21.11,0:00:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託大家了~
Comment: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以的話請收下吧
Comment: 0,0:00:26.87,0:00:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸?
Comment: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,固法學姐?
Comment: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託大家了~
Comment: 0,0:00:34.01,0:00:36.01,Default,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼固法學姐會幫澡堂做宣傳?
Comment: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,其實啊...
Comment: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,最近客人愈來愈少
Comment: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再這樣下去可能會倒掉...
Comment: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎... 怎麼會...
Comment: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,從小時候開始
Comment: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這間澡堂一直包容著我長大
Comment: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以 我才希望這間澡堂也一直經營下去
Comment: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,固法學姐
Comment: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果有什麼要幫忙的就儘管說吧
Comment: 0,0:00:59.45,0:01:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也來幫忙發傳單
Comment: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝妳們
Comment: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有沒有其他可以做的事情?
Comment: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以讓大家開心之類的
Comment: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,比如說在浴池飄著一大堆的玩具怎麼樣
Comment: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對小朋友的話是沒關係啦
Comment: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是我覺得對大人來說的話 會覺得全身不自在吧
Comment: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是這樣嗎...
Comment: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不然...
Comment: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就讓大家向後轉 把硬幣丟進浴池上的小船裡面
