Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:48.46,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姊姊大人!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對啊
